cmerge - consolidates the run databases of a sweep

    PYTHONPATH=src python tools/data/cmerge/main.py [-t template] [-o output] [-f] runs.txt

runs.txt names one maritime.workingset.s3db per line (relative paths are taken from the
list's folder; blank lines and # comments are skipped). Each database is copied, its copy
renumbered by cos.data.bi.Builder so ids do not collide, and every row merged into a fresh,
empty replica of the template (default config/data/maritime.s3db). Only id and dim_*_id
columns are renumbered; case_id and vessel_id are copied unchanged. The sources are never
written.
